# SKILL.md is held to a byte cap (ADR 0004). Keep it LF in the repository
# and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says, so the measured size
# is the committed size.
skills/diagram-design/SKILL.md text eol=lf

# Everything else text is LF in the repository and in every checkout, too.
# Generators (build-icons.py, the example builders) write LF, so a CRLF blob
# would turn every regeneration into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
